      "statusChangeNewStatus": "complete",
      "value": "This was fixed in the Udon Networking Update last year. Technically similar symptoms, but not to be confused with this newer issue that has completely different repro steps: https://feedback.vrchat.com/vrchat-udon-closed-alpha-bugs/p/1171-deserialization-fires-for-owner-and-serialized-data-is-overridden-by-old-da",
      "viewerReactions": null,
